        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SAHW325, Large Wall Mount Door Stop with Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis heavy duty wall mounted door stop features a holder / hook to secure the door against the rubber bumper and hold the door in an open position when desired. This heavy duty door stop includes new mounting hardware, open hook and eye to hold door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SAHW325U-specifications.gif?v=1704354499\" width=\"598\" height=\"221\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Large Wall Mount Door Stop with Hook Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-wall-mount-door-stop-deltana-dsw325\">Large Wall Mounted Door Stop Without the Hold Open Hook</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for the Deltana SAHW325 Wall Mount Door Stop with Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Projection: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Hook Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Hook Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-tip-for-heavy-duty-door-stops-deltana-dsf-rubber\"><b>Rubber Bumper</b></a>: 1\" Diameter, Black Rubber</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SAHW325.pdf?v=1691095374\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  SAHW325 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Wall Mount Bumper with Hook",
                "description": "Large Wall Mount Door Stop with Hook, Deltana SAHW325 - This heavy duty wall mounted door stop features a holder / hook to secure the door against the rubber bumper and hold the door in an open position when desired. This heavy duty door stop includes new mounting hardware, open hook and eye to hold door. It is available in 9 great finishes.",
